   "en": "{07 04 00}Whoa!{01 00 00 05 00}\n{0b 03 00}{04 1a 00}!\n\n{07 14 00}Well, well.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00} I'm impressed,{01 00 00 14 00}\n{01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!",
   "et": "{07 04 00}Ohoo!{01 00 00 05 00}\n{0b 03 00}{04 1a 00}!\n\n{07 14 00}Vaat nii.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00} Olen üllatunud,{01 00 00 14 00}\n{01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!"
  },
  {
   "id": 1,
   "en": "{07 04 00}Oh.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}\n{04 1a 00}{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.\n\n{07 00 00}Hey, {01 00 00 05 00}that's not so bad!{01 00 00 14 00}\nIt's better than I expected\nfrom that unstylish animal!",
   "et": "{07 04 00}Oi.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}\n{04 1a 00}{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.\n\n{07 00 00}Kuule, {01 00 00 05 00}see pole paha!{01 00 00 14 00}\nSee on parem, kui ma\nsellelt loomalt ootasin!"
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "en": "{07 04 00}Huh?{01 00 00 14 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}{07 03 00} Har har har!{01 00 00 0f 00}\n{0b 03 00}{04 1a 00},\n{01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}.\n{07 16 00}I don't know if I'd call it\nboring or practical.{01 00 00 05 00}\n\n{07 00 00}Either way,{01 00 00 05 00} it's something\nI'll use every day,\n{01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!",
   "et": "{07 04 00}Ah?{01 00 00 14 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}{07 03 00} Har har har!{01 00 00 0f 00}\n{0b 03 00}{04 1a 00},\n{01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}.\n{07 16 00}Ma ei tea, kas nimetada\nseda igavaks või nutikaks.{01 00 00 05 00}\n\n{07 00 00}Igatahes{01 00 00 05 00} on see midagi,\nmida ma iga päev kasutan,\n{01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!"
